            </note>
            <note corresp="#d22-f2" n="2" xml:id="d22-f2-content">
                <p>A memorandum of this conversation between Hickerson, Hulley, and Ambassador Erik
                    C. Boheman is in Department of State file No. 857D.20/1–1449.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d22-f3" n="3" xml:id="d22-f3-content">
                <p>This telegram, No. 17, was repeated to the Embassies in Denmark, Sweden, and
                    Great Britain as telegrams 18, 29, and 173, respectively.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d22-f4" n="4" xml:id="d22-f4-content">
